r-year timing differences to when we took price as opposed to a change in our pricing strategy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/13/brinker-international-inc-eat-q4-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"EAT 2020 Q2","e":"eat","d":"2020-01-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Wyman Roberts","x":"…the camp that we are totally bought into this approach toward marketing for the future that is direct to consumer marketing getting -- leveraging your database, leveraging our scale to use technology in a way that maybe others can't to get really smart about how we market to our guests and…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/brinker-international-inc-eat-q2-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"EAT 2020 Q2","e":"eat","d":"2020-01-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Wyman Roberts","x":"We've always been pretty clear that our price strategy is 1.5% to 2% and that given timing of when you take a price increase at quarter may be a little high, one may be a little low.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/brinker-international-inc-eat-q2-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"EAT 2020 Q2","e":"eat","d":"2020-01-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Wyman Roberts","x":"As we outlined in this morning's press release, the ongoing momentum in our business has enabled us to raise guidance for the year which Joe will detail for you in just a few minutes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/brinker-international-inc-eat-q2-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"EAT 2020 Q2","e":"eat","d":"2020-01-29","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"John Glass","x":"And then Joe, on ERJ, how much does that contribute to this quarter from an earnings perspective and is part of your increased guidance, you've got better visibility on better accretion than you initially thought from that acquisition?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/brinker-international-inc-eat-q2-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"EAT 2020 Q3","e":"eat","d":"2020-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Vaccaro","x":"I pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/brinker-international-inc-eat-q3-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"EAT 2020 Q3","e":"eat","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Taylor","x":"We took significant cost-cutting measures by eliminating nonessential spend and delaying our capital projects.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/brinker-international-inc-eat-q3-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"EAT 2020 Q4","e":"eat","d":"2020-08-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Gregory Francfort","x":"And then my second question is on pricing power and coming out of this.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/12/brinker-international-eat-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"EAT 2021 Q3","e":"eat","d":"2021-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Wyman Roberts","x":"And a lot of people took price and cut options.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/brinker-international-eat-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"EAT 2021 Q3","e":"eat","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Wyman Roberts","x":"I think you're going to see a significant restructuring in major metropolitan areas, obviously, in the New York Cities and the Chicagos.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/brinker-international-eat-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"EAT 2021 Q4","e":"eat","d":"2021-08-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Wyman Roberts","x":"And finally, because we chose not to take price at Chili's during fiscal '21, we have room to take some price this year as consumers return to work and income levels return to normal.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/18/brinker-international-eat-q4-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"EAT 2021 Q4","e":"eat","d":"2021-08-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Wyman Roberts","x":"We've kept pricing power intact, and we will use pricing power, particularly as we go through this fiscal year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/18/brinker-international-eat-q4-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"EAT 2022 Q1","e":"eat","d":"2021-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Wyman Roberts","x":"We know we have pricing power if we need it, particularly in the delivery in virtual brand channels and we're committed to maintaining our margins and our business model.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/brinker-international-eat-q1-2022-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"EAT 2022 Q1","e":"eat","d":"2021-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joe Taylor","x":"We are taking thoughtful incremental price increases to help offset these higher costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/brinker-international-eat-q1-2022-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"EAT 2022 Q2","e":"eat","d":"2022-02-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Wyman Roberts","x":"We've responded with appropriate pricing actions and with our most recent price increase, our menu price is now up over 4%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/03/brinker-international-eat-q2-2022-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"EAT 2022 Q2","e":"eat","d":"2022-02-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Wyman Roberts","x":"We've been deliberate about taking incremental price increases throughout the year to ensure that with every step, we protect our traffic advantage, and we've done exactly that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/03/brinker-international-eat-q2-2022-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"EAT 2022 Q3","e":"eat","d":"2022-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joe Taylor","x":"For the third quarter, Brinker recorded a year-over-year price increase of 4.3%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/04/brinker-international-eat-q3-2022-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"EAT 2022 Q3","e":"eat","d":"2022-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Wyman Roberts","x":"…understanding the guest reaction, and we've taken them across different channels, whether they be base business, virtual brands, delivery, to make sure that the impact to the demand side of the equation wasn't too onerous, that we weren't chasing away too many guests with these price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/04/brinker-international-eat-q3-2022-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"EAT 2022 Q3","e":"eat","d":"2022-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Wyman Roberts","x":"As we think about our value propositions, we are restructuring those as we talked about.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/04/brinker-international-eat-q3-2022-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"EAT 2022 Q4","e":"eat","d":"2022-08-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kevin Hochman","x":"But we do think that there we do have some pricing power in different areas in the business between being a little bit slower than the industry last year on taking everyday pricing, making sure that we have really sharp pricing for that guest that's cash trapped that's available in the restaurant…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/24/brinker-international-eat-q4-2022-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"EAT 2022 Q4","e":"eat","d":"2022-08-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joe Taylor","x":"We'll take, a series of different price increases, not necessarily just menu price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/24/brinker-international-eat-q4-2022-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"EAT 2022 Q4","e":"eat","d":"2022-08-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kevin Hochman","x":"We will also right-size the mix of everyday menu items offered on deal, but we'll make sure there's something available for the cashed-up customer who needs a superior value to enjoy casual dining.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/24/brinker-international-eat-q4-2022-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"EAT 2022 Q4","e":"eat","d":"2022-08-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kevin Hochman","x":"The team is looking at all aspects of operations from focusing on the menu, to streamlining back-of-house prep, to eliminating time-consuming processes that don't add value to our guest experience.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/24/brinker-international-eat-q4-2022-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"EAT 2025 Q4","e":"eat","d":"2025-08-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mika Ware","x":"You know, we were taking price in previous years at a much higher rate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/13/brinker-eat-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EAT 2025 Q4","e":"eat","d":"2025-08-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mika Ware","x":"Some good news with that is we don't have a lot of price increases planned, for the back half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/13/brinker-eat-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EAT 2026 Q1","e":"eat","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michaela M. Ware","x":"We are also currently expecting higher tariffs on commodities along with higher inflation in workers' comp and health insurance claims.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/brinker-eat-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EAT 2026 Q1","e":"eat","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michaela M. Ware","x":"The assumptions underlying our guidance largely remain unchanged except we now anticipate commodity inflation inclusive of tariffs in the mid-single digits rather than the low single digits as projected last quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/brinker-eat-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EAT 2026 Q2","e":"eat","d":"2026-01-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mika Ware","x":"…in the low single digits and our tax rate to be approximately 19%, Our commodity inflation is now anticipated to be in the low single digits for the fiscal year due to the removal of Brazil-based ground beef tariffs this past quarter and better than expected poultry and dairy commodity prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/28/brinker-eat-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EAT 2026 Q2","e":"eat","d":"2026-01-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mika Ware","x":"No. My outlook for commodities you know, we did have favorability in the tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/28/brinker-eat-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EAT 2026 Q2","e":"eat","d":"2026-01-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Chris O'Cull","x":"But as you as you lap these massive traffic gains, how do you prevent the ten ninety nine price point from becoming a structural ceiling on the pricing power?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/28/brinker-eat-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EAT 2026 Q2","e":"eat","d":"2026-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kevin Hochman","x":"So we continue to know, streamline the menu.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/28/brinker-eat-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EAT 2026 Q4","e":"eat","d":"2026-08-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"David Palmer","x":"I will pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/19/brinker-eat-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EAT 2027 Q1","e":"eat","d":"2026-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"David Palmer","x":"And I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/28/brinker-eat-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EAT 2027 Q1","e":"eat","d":"2026-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management",